    <string name="onboarding_welcome_title">Welcome to RoutinePilot</string>
    <string name="onboarding_welcome_body">Build routines from timed steps, run them with a timer, and plan the day around them. Everything works offline from the first launch.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_routines_title">Routines and schedules</string>
    <string name="onboarding_routines_body">A schedule repeats a routine, and it appears on your agenda each day. Use Plan on the schedules screen to fit flexible tasks into the free time.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_privacy_title">Your data, your choice</string>
    <string name="onboarding_privacy_body">Nothing is sent to a server unless you sign in to an account, and sign-in is optional. Routines and schedules work offline. Calendar export only writes to the calendar on this device, and you can turn it off at any time.</string>
    <string name="help_title">Help</string>
    <string name="help_routines_title">Routines and steps</string>
    <string name="help_routines_body">Add steps in order and give each one a duration in minutes. Move steps with the arrow buttons. Removing a step can be undone from the message that follows. Edits are kept until you press Save.</string>
    <string name="help_running_title">Running a routine</string>
    <string name="help_running_body">Start a routine to see a countdown for each timed step and the time left. You can pause, resume, skip, go back, finish, or cancel at any point. The timer keeps going in the background, and a notification shows the current step.</string>
    <string name="help_schedules_title">Schedules and the agenda</string>
    <string name="help_schedules_body">A schedule repeats a routine or a task every day, on chosen weekdays, or every few days. The agenda shows the items for the day, and you can complete, skip, or move each one. Stopping a schedule keeps its history.</string>
    <string name="help_planning_title">Planning a day</string>
    <string name="help_planning_body">Smart plan fits flexible tasks into the time left after your scheduled items, breaks, and working hours. You can pin a task to a time, and a pin is never moved for you. Preview changes nothing until you apply the plan.</string>
    <string name="help_progress_title">Progress</string>
    <string name="help_progress_body">Progress counts completed and missed items and the time you focused. A cancelled run keeps its focused time but is never counted as finished.</string>
    <string name="help_sync_title">Sync and your account</string>
    <string name="help_sync_body">Sign in to sync routines, tasks, and schedules between your devices. Changes made offline are kept and sent when you reconnect. If two devices change the same field, the later change wins and the replaced value is reported. Deleting an item another device changed asks you first.</string>
    <string name="help_privacy_title">Privacy and deleting data</string>
    <string name="help_privacy_body">Your data stays on this device unless you sign in. Signing out keeps the data here. Deleting the account removes its synced data from the server and erases the data on this device. Calendar events created by export stay in your calendar app until you remove them.</string>
</resources>
